      "message": "Add workflow to mirror repository to Gitea\n\nAdds .github/workflows/mirror-gitea.yml: a GitHub Actions workflow that mirrors the repository to a Gitea instance. It runs weekly (Sundays 00:00 UTC) and supports manual dispatch, checks out full history (fetch-depth: 0), and force-pushes all branches and tags to the configured Gitea remote using the GITEA_TOKEN secret. Update USERNAME/REPO in the workflow and ensure GITEA_TOKEN is set in repository secrets before use.",
